web: web/backend service: models, repositories, routes, templates, queries, roles
game: game: components and systems, AI state machines, wave tables, inventories, behaviors
cli: CLI tool: argument parsing, commands, table output, configuration
data: data analysis: columns, group-by, pipelines, CSV rows
gui: GUI application: widgets and layout, reducers, styles, events
embedded: embedded: registers and bit fields, ring buffers, CRC tables, framing state machines
compiler: compiler/interpreter: lexers, ASTs and evaluators, stack VMs, type tables
scientific: scientific/numeric: polynomials, quadrature, matrices, ODE steps
generic-lib: generic-heavy library in one entry file: generic records and functions instantiated per model
generated: generated code: message structs, registries, lookup tables, accessors
